╭──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮
│ keepalive                                             v2.0.0 │
│                                                              │
│ KEYS                                                         │
│ [↑↓] choose how long           [a]  simulate activity        │
│ [⏎]  start                     [d]  keep the display on      │
│ [?]  this help                 [b]  stop at a battery level  │
│ [q]  quit                      [k]  tap Shift with activity  │
│                                                              │
│ Simulate activity makes small pointer arcs (up to 130 px)    │
│ once you are idle, so Teams and Slack show you as Active.    │
│ It pauses while you use the computer or the screen is        │
│ locked; "keepalive doctor" checks that it works.             │
│ Logs: off; start with --log to write                         │
│ /home/u/.cache/keepalive/keepalive.log                       │
╰──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╯
 [esc] close  [ctrl+c] quit
